# Every snapshot in this repo (CSV / JSON / HTML) is LF + UTF-8 without BOM, so this
# normalization never changes bytes and the sha256 ledger in data/synthetic/manifest.json
# stays valid in any clone. Any future binary or non-LF snapshot MUST be marked `-text`
# here, otherwise checkout rewrites its bytes and the ledger silently fails
# (`git status` cannot see it). The invariant is gate-checked over the archive snapshot by
# tests/test_skeleton.py::TestSnapshotEncoding -- add a binary suffix there too.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
